{"v":2,"catch":"又是派對派對的時間了！\n大家一起加入，讓我們開派對！","desc":"介紹一款全新的派對遊戲，讓大家輕鬆上手，玩得開心！\n分享Joy-Con™，最多可讓6位玩家加入派對！\n\n簡化、增強且直觀的控制讓每一次玩耍都無限歡樂又輕鬆！\n與朋友和家人一較高下，讓歡樂時光滾滾而來！\n\n[自由模式]\n選擇你最喜愛的遊戲，立即開始玩！\n享受額外的合作遊戲選擇，你必須攜手合作才能成功！\n\n[派對模式]\n選擇接連玩的遊戲，爭奪派對冠軍！\n\n[線上模式]\n無論距離多遠，一起在線上玩得開心！\n即使遠在天邊，也能與朋友實時玩遊戲！\n\n[角色編輯]\n設計你自己的角色，邀請他們來參加派對一起玩！\n\n[動作控制]\n揮動、旋轉和傾斜Joy-Con™，享受動態的遊戲體驗！","publisher":"SAT-BOX","release":"2024-02-15","genres":["派對","動作"],"players":"單機 1–6 人 · 網路 2–4 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":6,"poff":6,"size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a36c3714ed9516b5fa84c6bfa7a00a8b1828092a2405cb0f6c6a64abdaf27c9f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ce016e576894c490a6b81a9930f52a82c91719ffc16a7bcf7fe4a167fd067253.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4c1d5103a2f1db1834741e353b209cf4b83445fb8c7d996d07b133f726f0cbf2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bf0d19c25c36bcd6821926ab772d20b19330da590c50fc8b6f19445ccf9fb78d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7b3c47b85c582f8201bd30bd2e8f15104f15670454ece7aea289af2f3bcde10e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14150ca33ee5bef8af290880debd6d583f3667c440fc45714ad86dd0387d5eab.jpg"],"dlc":[{"id":"70050000048139","name":"Party Hustle Pack","img":"54b97aa1d5a0d9379257c57e777fa0b3a7cc3fd1e39d453c20aff5e77c2a6b1f","date":"2024-03-28","mem":false},{"id":"70050000048760","name":"Party Spirit Pack","img":"e2cc9eef272e6849b5ec22dc818f43be49074406fd5461680fe3387cd50208a8","date":"2024-05-02","mem":false},{"id":"70070000021754","name":"Party Hustle Pack + Party Spirit Pack","img":"c7282a58bc8b4358580c3a1e3ab6d459271346b955487c75b1f5c48e923ac66b","date":"2024-05-02","mem":false}],"dlcTotal":6,"titleId":"0100ffe01dbfe000"}